  "title": "This, that, someone",
  "description": "Point at things, and talk about people without naming them.",
  "grammar": "demonstratives, and words for people and things",
  "grammarNote": "These words stand in for a noun: eso es mi coche. Alguien and nadie work the same way.",
  "items": [
